  "details": "Not sure if it even works.\n\nThis is comes from more the android side of things, where I noticed a number of options appear in the Menu and Action Menu.\n\nAt current moment, there are some issues and concerns with using OSC on both:\n\n- Does OSC Even work?\n\n- How would a user assign the IP / ports?\n\n- The OSC Debug Menu doesn't even open on Android Mobile\n\n- How would a user edit the OSC file to configure what parameters are exposed?",
